# Source photography for the menu (~21MB of webp).
# Not tracked: the originals are the designer's, and every one of them is already
# uploaded to the Supabase `menu-images` bucket under menu-v3/, which is what the
# app actually serves. supabase/seed/menu_v3.json records which file became which
# item, so the mapping survives even without the folder.
/Digital_Menu_Item_Images (webp 800)/

# Local preview of the menu photography review (half a MB of inlined images)
menu-photo-review.html

# Review batch of regenerated menu photos (not yet approved)
menu-images-v2/
menu-photo-review-2.html
menu-photo-review-final.html

# Menu photography masters — 15MB, mirrored in Supabase Storage
/menu-images/
*.zip

# Local QA review list
qa-review.html

# Session-local Claude Code permissions
.claude/settings.local.json

# Marketing image assets — large binaries, kept out of the code repo
social-media/
